# Cargo build artifacts for the zkvm sub-workspace (excluded from the main
# workspace in ../Cargo.toml). The compiled guest ELF that
# reserve-coverage-host embeds via include_bytes! is force-added below since
# it's a build output the host crate depends on, not a build byproduct.
reserve-coverage-host/target/
reserve-coverage-verifier/target/*
!reserve-coverage-verifier/target/elf-compilation/
reserve-coverage-verifier/target/elf-compilation/*
!reserve-coverage-verifier/target/elf-compilation/riscv64im-succinct-zkvm-elf/
reserve-coverage-verifier/target/elf-compilation/riscv64im-succinct-zkvm-elf/*
!reserve-coverage-verifier/target/elf-compilation/riscv64im-succinct-zkvm-elf/release/
reserve-coverage-verifier/target/elf-compilation/riscv64im-succinct-zkvm-elf/release/*
!reserve-coverage-verifier/target/elf-compilation/riscv64im-succinct-zkvm-elf/release/reserve-coverage-verifier
Cargo.lock
